  array([[1, 2, 2, 1],
         [5, 6, 7, 8]], dtype=int32)

  Args:
    data: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `float32`, `float64`, `int32`, `uint8`, `int16`, `int8`, `int64`, `bfloat16`, `uint16`, `half`, `uint32`, `uint64`.
    segment_ids: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `int32`, `int64`.
